      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 02 · AI Appointment Scheduler\nReads free-text booking requests, extracts date/time with AI, creates a Google Calendar event and emails a confirmation (or asks for missing details).\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/appointment-scheduler` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Calendar OAuth2, OpenAI API.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Rahul\",\n \"email\": \"rahul@example.com\",\n \"message\": \"Can we do a 30 min demo next Tuesday at 3pm IST?\"\n}\n```"
      }
